    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 43,
        "text": "Hi, Tom. You look tired. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "fc39c9ed2b1e10c14195d653791c9489a7b8838945975685ee0f65571f7cf7ae",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 49,
        "sourceEnd": 156,
        "text": "Yeah, I’m fine. I just came back from the gym. I’m trying to exercise more because I sit at a desk all day.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "dc6703f587124312cb17047e40c873acb441371309f79dc412ce0a0bc33335dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 162,
        "sourceEnd": 242,
        "text": "That’s good. I might start yoga, but I’m not sure. I heard it’s good for stress.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "c89ebe2068307b2587a0d740ebc20318d6a88e23e38c8bd4ed3c54caf20ff1d7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 248,
        "sourceEnd": 381,
        "text": "You should try it. My sister does yoga every morning, and she says it helps her focus. But it can be expensive if you go to a studio.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "824d8eb5cd5867ba737e841ae19f927e5fc0ae7eb5a29ca8330e34612d291b26",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 387,
        "sourceEnd": 451,
        "text": "Right. I could do it at home with videos. That might be cheaper.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "132e9d9a74dcd0ecd5048013bc93c7e46ffbf5dc45af05142fa22b311781ef06",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 457,
        "sourceEnd": 521,
        "text": "Exactly. So, what about your diet? Are you eating healthier now?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1ea7c77c1fcabcf1cca4e18c58fab4cfdb517d41e5e84d5f872238a0d51da86c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 527,
        "sourceEnd": 640,
        "text": "Well, I try to eat more vegetables, but I still eat too much sugar. I know it’s bad for me, but I love chocolate.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "bd45801a728b9c370047ab609331eed239bf9d13846b43f0393fca129f1929dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 646,
        "sourceEnd": 761,
        "text": "I understand. I used to drink soda every day, but I stopped because my doctor told me to. Now I drink water or tea.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0b2ff55623dd120c65880af5815602a6e7afecfea27140deed5565079a1dae94",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 767,
        "sourceEnd": 843,
        "text": "That’s impressive. I can’t give up chocolate. Maybe I can reduce it, though.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "da4a3cfc4f22ace324a13444ae5d9661c069b1d60c7951d4270d29b214dbf83f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 849,
        "sourceEnd": 903,
        "text": "That’s a good start. Small changes are easier to keep.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "4a7ca719fd275d509f96acfdda7a82a139e8d3ecffbbaa7901361f40a23b0d5b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 909,
        "sourceEnd": 1004,
        "text": "By the way, did you see the news about the new park? They’re going to build it near our office.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "61bcd94e972c7ac28cef83e82f66083018556e17c549744a789e5a0e32a65237",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1010,
        "sourceEnd": 1157,
        "text": "Yes, I read about it. I think it’s a great idea because we need more green spaces. But some people disagree. They say it will be noisy and crowded.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "56aa271e46346a4b16e7f8fbef7617182d72262dcd157a96396271083081b66e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1163,
        "sourceEnd": 1255,
        "text": "I can see their point, but I still support the park. It might encourage people to walk more.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "73f05ad92bdf25df967bfad9445d129b4cab17c1ff5e00bdd5afed2f2dfe09c5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1261,
        "sourceEnd": 1328,
        "text": "True. Although it may take a year to finish, I think it’s worth it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "f2337b7a2907516327e10f9c1696c6ef72e8add03c6ed0902ad0058ed1fc3110",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1334,
        "sourceEnd": 1386,
        "text": "Me too. So, are you going to the gym again tomorrow?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "34a89c810820fd066e03b499ec05dd31515aa07e491467883f3e6921b40da16f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1392,
        "sourceEnd": 1473,
        "text": "I might. It depends on how I feel. But I can go with you if you want to try yoga.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "1370bd0c94cd4caee3110342e71255e8706b0ca4e5704c04bee544d01dadf2c6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1479,
        "sourceEnd": 1534,
        "text": "Really? That would be great. But I’m not very flexible.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "67ce9814e12bdb099c4b508199028c4a7dda15fedd23d3add32c88c1195b3f90",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "tom",
        "speaker": "Tom",
        "sourceStart": 1540,
        "sourceEnd": 1623,
        "text": "Don’t worry. Everyone starts somewhere. You can borrow my sister’s mat if you like.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-ChristopherNeural",
        "textHash": "0473b389912d4f3a3101dfd3b0c27f18ac4a01ce1b815cae1e451f16d7c8e604",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1629,
        "sourceEnd": 1683,
        "text": "Thanks! I’ll think about it. I may join you next week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-MichelleNeural",
        "textHash": "33debc35150d1f212f76d442393abb24d55e961689953b0412c3068393c7f57f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
